text:
The ordered pair \( (-1,5) \) is a solution of this system.
\begin{equation*}
 \begin{linsys}{2}
 3x_1 &+ &2x_2 &= &7 \\
 -x_1 &+ &x_2 &= &6
 \end{linsys}
\end{equation*}
In contrast, \( (5,-1) \) is not a solution.

