text:
[Triangle Inequality] 
For any \( \vec{u},\vec{v}\in\mathbb{R}^n \),
\begin{equation*}
 \absval{\vec{u}+\vec{v}\,}\leq\absval{\vec{u}\,}+\absval{\vec{v}\,}
\end{equation*}
with equality if and only if one of the vectors is a nonnegative scalar
multiple of the other one.

