text:
The \textbf{angle} 
between two nonzero vectors \( \vec{u},\vec{v}\in\mathbb{R}^n \) is
\begin{equation*}
 \theta
 =
 \arccos(\,\frac{\vec{u}\dotprod\vec{v}}{
 \absval{\vec{u}\,}\,\absval{\vec{v}\,} }\,)
\end{equation*}
(if either is the zero vector then we take the angle to be a right angle).

