text:
To convert from the matrix $H$ representing a map $h$ with respect to $B,D$
to the matrix $\hat{H}$ 
representing it with respect to $\hat{B},\hat{D}$ use this formula.
\begin{equation*}
 \hat{H}=
 \rep{\identity}{D,\hat{D}}\cdot H\cdot \rep{\identity}{\hat{B},B}
 \tag*{\text{($*$})}
\end{equation*}

