text:
The linear equation
\( a_1x_1+a_2x_2+\,\cdots\,+a_nx_n=d \)
with unknowns \( x_1,\ldots\,,x_n \)
is \textbf{satisfied}
 by
\begin{equation*}
 \vec{s}=\colvec{s_1 \\ \vdotswithin{s_1} \\ s_n}
\end{equation*}
if \( a_1s_1+a_2s_2+\,\cdots\,+a_ns_n=d \).
A vector satisfies a linear system if it satisfies each equation in 
the system.

